### Test Create Deposit Request (User Only)
POST http://localhost:3000/deposits/request
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100.50,
  "description": "Initial deposit"
}

### Test Get Pending Deposits (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:3000/deposits/pending
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Approve Deposit (Admin Only)
POST http://localhost:3000/deposits/approve
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "TRANSACTION_UUID_HERE"
}

### Test Get User Deposits (User Only)
GET http://localhost:3000/deposits/my-deposits
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Get Wallet Balance (User Only)
GET http://localhost:3000/wallet/balance
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Transfer to Another User (User Only)
POST http://localhost:3000/wallet/transfer
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientEmail": "recipient@example.com",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "description": "Payment for services"
}

### Test Pay with Balance (User Only)
POST http://localhost:3000/wallet/pay
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 25.00,
  "description": "Purchase item"
}

### Test Get Transaction History (User Only)
GET http://localhost:3000/wallet/transactions
